MoDE — Mixture of Diverse Experts
Copyright (c) 2026 Hanzo AI, Inc.

MoDE routes across expert modules harvested from open-weight models. The experts are
those models' own trained weights, used frozen and unmodified, under their own licenses.
Their capabilities are their authors' work, not ours. Hanzo's contribution is the
complexity estimator, the cross-architecture alignment layer, the router, and the
identity/agentic/abliteration training applied on top.

